{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51378","headline":"谢庐山僧寄谷帘水 · 张又新","name":"谢庐山僧寄谷帘水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"消渴陵客，甘凉庐阜泉。\n泻从千仞石，寄逐阴江船。\n竹柜新茶出，铜铛活火煎。\n育花浮晚菊，沸沫响秋蝉。\n啜忆吴僧共，倾宜越椀圆。\n气清宁怕睡，骨健欲成仙。\n吏役寻无暇，诗情得有缘。\n深疑尝沆瀣，犹欠听潺湲。\n迢递康王谷，尘埃陆羽篇。\n何当结茅屋，长在水帘前。\n（《正德南康府志》十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张又新","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}